grund.toml is read as version 2.

unknown-project
A citation names a project alias that is not known, or a declaration or section that project does not have.

Severity: error, fixed.
On: always.
Fix, root: run `grund check` from the workspace root at `{root}` to validate cross-project citations
Fix, subtree: check from the workspace root for a path outside that subtree
Fix, near: did you mean {near}?
Fix, unlisted: add "{entry}" to [workspace] members in {enclosing}
